# rootfs/.dockerignore — rootfs/ context (used by: controlplane/Dockerfile, worker/Dockerfile)
#
# controlplane and worker build contexts are rootfs/ root.
# Include only what those Dockerfiles actually COPY:
#   rke2/install.sh  → install script only (airgap bundles excluded — too large)
#   controlplane/*   → config + labs for vm2
#   worker/*         → config + labs for vm3-5
#
# Exclude the bootstrap/ tree (158 MB nkp binary) and any other noise.

# ── default: exclude everything ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*

# rke2 install script only — exclude the 1.7 GB .tar.zst bundles
!rke2/
!rke2/install.sh

# controlplane-specific files
!controlplane/
!controlplane/**

# worker-specific files
!worker/
!worker/**

# exclude bootstrap entirely — not needed for controlplane/worker builds
bootstrap/
